  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 610.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 610.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to the tidal buffer zone established in RSA 482-A and to all protected shoreland in coastal areas established by RSA 483-B, referred to collectively as the protected tidal zone.\n\nSource. #12806, eff 12-15-19",
